{"data":{"id":"a9_l9e_iYHU","slug":"bj-the-chicago-kid","title":"BJ the Chicago Kid","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"274HRHeYpiA","slug":"fancy","title":"Fancy"},{"id":"Frxuz9-8mhI","slug":"good-luvn","title":"Good Luv'n"},{"id":"2lchZh6XoeI","slug":"turnin-me-up-acoustic","title":"Turnin' Me Up (Acoustic)"},{"id":"0N4xiNBdEfY","slug":"uncle-marvin-bjtck-ft-marvin-gaye","title":"UNCLE MARVIN BJTCK FT MARVIN GAYE"},{"id":"CZjJRBsvPJM","slug":"letter-2-u","title":"Letter 2 U"},{"id":"lj0DiCDqUMM","slug":"can-you-handle-it-superstar","title":"CAN YOU HANDLE IT/ SUPERSTAR"},{"id":"pgWDRVYe2oc","slug":"man-down-ft-buddy-and-constantine","title":"Man Down ft. Buddy & Constantine"},{"id":"6AoqKFFs6FU","slug":"where-i-wanna-be-live","title":"Where I Wanna Be (Live)"},{"id":"3P_QqziGREo","slug":"get-away-feat-jid-buddy-and-kent-jamz","title":"Get Away (feat. JID, Buddy & Kent Jamz)"}]},"markers":[{"id":"sUTEna-lszo","position":2,"timestamp":"00:03:40","rawTrack":"BJ the Chicago Kid - Fancy","track":{"id":"274HRHeYpiA","path":"/artists/bj-the-chicago-kid/tracks/fancy/","slug":"fancy","title":"Fancy","artist":{"slug":"bj-the-chicago-kid","title":"BJ the Chicago Kid"},"artwork":"images/artists/bj-the-chicago-kid/tracks/fancy.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"jfWdtvgF18Y","slug":"520","tags":[5,6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-520/ra.1583087610","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-520-andres-javier-uribe-takeover"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #520 (Andres Javier Uribe Takeover)","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-520.jpg","content":"Andres Javier Uribe takes control of the music.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2021-09-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Andres Javier Uribe's Session","position":0}},{"id":"66IW21IAOGU","position":3,"timestamp":"00:06:04","rawTrack":"BJ the Chicago Kid - Fancy","track":{"id":"274HRHeYpiA","path":"/artists/bj-the-chicago-kid/tracks/fancy/","slug":"fancy","title":"Fancy","artist":{"slug":"bj-the-chicago-kid","title":"BJ the Chicago Kid"},"artwork":"images/artists/bj-the-chicago-kid/tracks/fancy.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"PoVC_T25cT8","slug":"532","tags":[5,6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-532/ra.1598473112","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-532-andre-power-takeover?in=soulection/sets/soulection-radio-sessions"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #532 (Andre Power Takeover)","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-532.jpg","content":"Andre Power takes control of the Soulection spaceship.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2021-12-11T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Andre Power's Session","position":0}},{"id":"N7pRTUWQDxw","position":4,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"BJ the Chicago Kid - Good Luv'n'","track":{"id":"Frxuz9-8mhI","path":"/artists/bj-the-chicago-kid/tracks/good-luv-n/","slug":"good-luvn","title":"Good Luv'n","artist":{"slug":"bj-the-chicago-kid","title":"BJ the Chicago Kid"},"artwork":"images/artists/bj-the-chicago-kid/tracks/good-luv-n.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"IgJtl2M_Vk0","slug":"140","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-140-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #140 w/ Esta & Andres","artwork":"/images/episodes/140.jpg","content":"\nESTA and Andres stop on by and deliver solid sets.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nHad to start this show with a new unreleased gem from Kaytra and play all the classics/unreleased material as usual. Esta finally stopped by to drop an official set and talk about what's next for him. He really impressed us with his house vibes. This man is diverse. Andres also came through and graced us with a heavy hitter set. Spread this if you feel it.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10805,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-10T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Andres' Set","position":2}},{"id":"sdxAAxTuoW0","position":14,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"BJ The Chicago Kid - Good Luv'n","track":{"id":"Frxuz9-8mhI","path":"/artists/bj-the-chicago-kid/tracks/good-luv-n/","slug":"good-luvn","title":"Good Luv'n","artist":{"slug":"bj-the-chicago-kid","title":"BJ the Chicago Kid"},"artwork":"images/artists/bj-the-chicago-kid/tracks/good-luv-n.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"zg_8tfPfypk","slug":"144","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-144-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #144 w/ starRo","artwork":"/images/episodes/144.jpg","content":"\nstarRo hails all the way from Tokyo, Japan to play original productions and edits.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nThere have been so many guests on Soulection Radio over the past years but no one, we repeat, no one has came in the studio so humble, so low key and just murk the airwaves like starRo did. \nIt's crazy to think that this man has been making music for over 15 years and is barely coming to surface to the world with so much heat. \nWe are just glad he is on our team. He played nothing but original production/edits. \nHailing all the way from Tokyo, Japan, starRo is an artist who you will be familiar with starting from this point on. \nJoe Kay of course opened the show for the first hour & 50 minutes on one turntable (one of the turntable's went out before the show started) playing a bunch of heat that he was holding onto since last week. \nHe made sure to make up for his absence last saturday and play some exclusive Carmack, Atu, Kaytra, Esta, Esgar, Jo Def + some other heavy footwork vibes.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10812,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-14T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"Qps0w-e7W5M","position":101,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"BJ the Chicago Kid - Good Luv'n","track":{"id":"Frxuz9-8mhI","path":"/artists/bj-the-chicago-kid/tracks/good-luv-n/","slug":"good-luvn","title":"Good Luv'n","artist":{"slug":"bj-the-chicago-kid","title":"BJ the Chicago Kid"},"artwork":"images/artists/bj-the-chicago-kid/tracks/good-luv-n.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"6HHQNRsrLR0","slug":"146","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-146"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #146","artwork":"/images/episodes/146.jpg","content":"Joe Kay hits hard with 3 hours of HEAVY tracks on 1 hour of sleep\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThere is something for everybody in here. Lots of unreleased music + music that was forgotten about. Shouts to all the amazing people who tuned in to the live show. Every once in a while we like to make a post about the location of our radio listeners and it's always inspiring to see how many people are actually tuning in and the locations that they reside in. We can't even pronounce some of the cities/countries! Talk about worldwide. Lets keep it moving.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-28T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"b7WAZ2cppEA","position":57,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"BJ the Chicago Kid - Good Luv'n","track":{"id":"Frxuz9-8mhI","path":"/artists/bj-the-chicago-kid/tracks/good-luv-n/","slug":"good-luvn","title":"Good Luv'n","artist":{"slug":"bj-the-chicago-kid","title":"BJ the Chicago Kid"},"artwork":"images/artists/bj-the-chicago-kid/tracks/good-luv-n.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"nbke6-Mfddk","slug":"161","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-161"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #161","artwork":"/images/episodes/161.jpg","content":"Joe focuses on new tracks from forthcoming Soulection releases.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nJoe also announced some hints about what to expect in the coming months. We have so much in store for you. \nWe're only a couple of weeks in to the new year and already we feel like we have hit some milestones. \n\nStay tuned. \n\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10868,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-18T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"tMC3_9Dlfig","position":7,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"BJ the Chicago Kid - Good Luv'n","track":{"id":"Frxuz9-8mhI","path":"/artists/bj-the-chicago-kid/tracks/good-luv-n/","slug":"good-luvn","title":"Good Luv'n","artist":{"slug":"bj-the-chicago-kid","title":"BJ the Chicago Kid"},"artwork":"images/artists/bj-the-chicago-kid/tracks/good-luv-n.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"ds5J8Q4FpEQ","slug":"174","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-174-w-iman-omari"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #174 w/ Iman Omari","artwork":"/images/episodes/174.jpg","content":"Playing many tracks across 4 Sets\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":11043,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-05-10T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"j8LLd83IL_A","position":32,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"BJ the Chicago Kid - Good Luv'n","track":{"id":"Frxuz9-8mhI","path":"/artists/bj-the-chicago-kid/tracks/good-luv-n/","slug":"good-luvn","title":"Good Luv'n","artist":{"slug":"bj-the-chicago-kid","title":"BJ the Chicago Kid"},"artwork":"images/artists/bj-the-chicago-kid/tracks/good-luv-n.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"9hHKn1wcY4c","slug":"186","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"so